<title>UK: All five Brent dates kept by equity holders.</title>
<headline>All five Brent dates kept by equity holders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>All five Brent dates turning wet today were kept by the equity holders, leaving the December market looking increasingly tight, traders said.</p>
<p>They said Texaco, J. Aron and Phibro had all kept December 14-16 loading cargoes, while a Dec 15-17 cargo was held by J.P. Morgan and a Dec 16-17 by Phibro.</p>
<p>-- Colin Wooster, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7456</p>
